  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building the resilience in education in Somali region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to improved access to and learning outcome through strengthened resilience and learning environement in schools in the crisis ridden Somali-region. The project will aling to the Education Cannot Wait Ethiopia Multi Year Resilience Plan building on learning outcome thorugh literacy and numeracy and with a focus on inlcusiveness and girls education.</narrative>
  </description>
